{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0444_1000_p", "source_sha256": "4645da5b15ee6be4b0fb73ce658ca7ea6f098370603b7396347f678435a84048", "ja": "（まつりの新曲のPV撮影が終わった。とても優雅で\n雰囲気のある映像になること間違いなしだ！）", "zh": "（まつり的新曲PV拍摄结束了。这一定会成为一部非常优雅、充满氛围感的影像！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0444_1001_021mat", "source_sha256": "78c67d254352278a76102cd2d872f94044056f03421e67f3ea59de39e4bf854b", "ja": "とびきり・すぺしゃるな舞踏会になったのです♪\nまだキラキラした気持ちが残っているのです……。", "zh": "变成了一场超级特别的舞会哦♪\n现在心里还留着那份闪闪发光的感觉……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0444_1002_p", "source_sha256": "afdf22ec4416cd5c2c7c6d5bc4b78fd66740a06220030226128663282cd29da0", "ja": "ああ。素敵な撮影だったからな。\nもう少し余韻を感じたいくらいだ。", "zh": "啊。因为这次拍摄非常精彩。\n真想再多沉浸一会儿这份余韵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0444_1003_021mat", "source_sha256": "d7e0003c6140950f89741c8192c4a1ef9e0ea65423d59599f590fd2f6a8e584c", "ja": "よく分かっているのです♪\n今感じている気持ちを、胸に刻んでおくのです……。", "zh": "你理解得非常透彻♪\n把现在感受到的心情，铭刻在心中吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0444_1004_021mat", "source_sha256": "aea47087cd79986464b2100de8af235bf90c6008e92591db3bd06dcbdc3adacd", "ja": "そうすることで、もっとたくさんの人に\nキラキラ・ぱわほー！をお届けできるのですよ！", "zh": "这样一来，就能把闪闪发光、活力满满的感觉传递给更多人了哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0444_1005_p", "source_sha256": "003dfa7e8e3eb71d5f21343d0b0dca505aa0fcd45d7dff125335a092086f0bf0", "ja": "そうだな。それじゃ、しばらく残っててもいいか、\nスタッフさんに聞いてみるよ。", "zh": "是啊。那我去问问工作人员，能不能再留一阵子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0444_1006_021mat", "source_sha256": "499698d11a18de02afd0c5f5cf9da9eec7f9a39c2fc5dcf697df15628f7964d3", "ja": "ありがとうなのです、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "谢谢您哦，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0444_1007_p", "source_sha256": "55e91d02c5859e3c14f3316c747467eaf15754cb45edecf85b90b6a0216bf425", "ja": "長居はできないけど、少しだけなら大丈夫だそうだ。\nよかったな、まつり。", "zh": "听说虽然不能待太久，但只待一会儿还是没问题的。太好了，茉莉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0444_1008_021mat", "source_sha256": "14c9c8e689f10d868285c2aaa2b182667c01bc6b827ccacc9bc702cee7783f1f", "ja": "はいほー！　それでは……はい、なのです♪", "zh": "嗨喉！那么……好的哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0444_1009_p", "source_sha256": "eab943fc2cd5d27d26b04e1f455329e3601cdeda0ad008ebd0f0ef8f4fbd67a6", "ja": "ん？　この手は？", "zh": "嗯？这只手是？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0444_1010_021mat", "source_sha256": "ef792a007127360f03f2b1daadb48119fb9c5a853043793f5522c99e4df29102", "ja": "ここにずっといたら、邪魔になってしまうのです。\nだから……はい♪", "zh": "要是一直待在这里，会给大家添麻烦的。\n所以……给你♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0444_1011_p", "source_sha256": "71ab4dddf892326dd497a90500ec71beef7ef581152a6b56aabaa07180320a1d", "ja": "どういうことだ？", "zh": "这是怎么说？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0444_1012_021mat", "source_sha256": "8f93b736a77f801f5e376270a1bb929ee68b54d0d64e0e3763b1c484782093c2", "ja": "姫は、今日のことを忘れたくないのです。\nだからもっと記憶に残るようなことをしたいのです。", "zh": "公主不想忘记今天的事。\n所以想做一些更令人难忘的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0444_1013_p", "source_sha256": "f8277fe6f3e75b7e4e79bea16811fad2c38a28ab2a882b15cb5f0cb316aae48f", "ja": "記憶に残るようなこと？", "zh": "留下深刻记忆的事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0444_1014_021mat", "source_sha256": "c2939380d61f41a5399563912579c5caedf3227e5c641d6bac9bd336db4223e6", "ja": "はいなのです。またこの場所に来た時、\n今日の撮影を思い出せるように……。", "zh": "是的哦。为了以后再次来到这里时，能够回想起今天的拍摄……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0444_1015_021mat", "source_sha256": "00652b8aab19af82df2088a15b9a4d0cc844310bdeddafd0a73768c10ab59b6c", "ja": "姫は、{$P$}さんとお話しながら\n一緒に歩きたいのです♪", "zh": "公主想一边和{$P$}先生聊天，\n一边一起漫步呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0444_1016_p", "source_sha256": "5e9ce6729c23fa8cd8c6bbda86f8c6f043a11cdf3cffa1f21def918cc52fb4a5", "ja": "そういうことだったのか。\nそれなら……お手をどうぞ、お姫様。", "zh": "原来是这么回事。\n既然这样……请牵我的手吧，公主殿下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0444_1017_021mat", "source_sha256": "3c3b29c87d606983f40f5458168112996ae23d911e4fb3cc110180f94b886c43", "ja": "……ほ？", "zh": "……吼？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0444_1018_p", "source_sha256": "f6aa433d5e3a858f49fb460070ab2e08adbb74fa96a2f9c0ca46aa088e4630b5", "ja": "あれ？　エスコートはナイト様の役目だと\n思ったんだけど……違ったか？", "zh": "哎？我以为护送是骑士大人的职责来着……\n难道不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0444_1019_021mat", "source_sha256": "157878be826687b880dccc8b85a4970459510ce62ef179cabd5188a9a4825782", "ja": "ち、違わないのです！　姫は、嬉しくて……。\nやっぱり、ズルいのです……。", "zh": "不、不是的！公主只是太高兴了……果然，还是太狡猾了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0444_1020_p", "source_sha256": "f2b6b6648b9069e7c6f1dde0ccd0c50908d4150914aaab1bf5eecad56f1139cc", "ja": "ん？　まつり？", "zh": "嗯？茉莉？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0444_1021_021mat", "source_sha256": "eca7c69cc59cd5c648f897cd0e4fc20ec0ce6879694ce903e106314d7381dd72", "ja": "なんでもないのです！\n今日はとことん付き合ってもらうのですよ♪", "zh": "没什么啦！\n今天要陪我到最后哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0444_1022_021mat", "source_sha256": "3bb9717360103afb051e46194413cf9c8aff1906a1f780d0f8e89405e0591094", "ja": "……そしてこれからも一緒に、同じ夢を見ていてね。", "zh": "……还有今后也要一起，做着同样的梦哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
